  "description": "<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"524\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"209\">Waarom kiezen voor deze Bluetooth 5.0 ontvanger?</strong><br data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"212\">Met deze <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"248\">Bluetooth 5.0 ontvanger</strong> voorzie je eenvoudig je autoradio, versterker of speakers van draadloze connectiviteit. Sluit hem aan via de 3,5mm jack en stream direct muziek vanaf je smartphone, tablet of laptop. Dankzij de stabiele Bluetooth 5.0-verbinding geniet je van helder geluid zonder storingen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"609\">Dit exemplaar is <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"552\">nieuw</strong>, ongebruikt en wordt geleverd in originele verpakking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"644\">⭐ Belangrijkste pluspunten:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<li data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"700\">📡 Bluetooth 5.0 voor stabiele en snelle verbinding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"761\">🎶 Stream draadloos muziek vanaf je smartphone of tablet</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"795\">🔊 Aansluiting via 3,5mm jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"860\">🚗 Ideaal voor auto, versterker of speakers zonder Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"896\">🆕 Nieuw en ongebruikt geleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"921\">📋 Specificaties:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"933\">Type:</strong> Bluetooth ontvanger</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"985\"><strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"979\">Bluetooth-versie:</strong> 5.0</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1017\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1004\">Aansluiting:</strong> 3,5mm jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1048\"><strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1031\">Bereik:</strong> Tot ± 10 meter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1094\"><strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1063\">Voeding:</strong> USB (via meegeleverde kabel)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1113\">Meegeleverd:</strong> USB-kabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1184\">Toestand:</strong> Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1230\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1220\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</p>",
